      "content": "that's exactly what happened this morning. i took a different route to the park just to see if anything would change, and i saw one of those guys from the park entrance again, just standing there watching me. it's getting really intense. do you think i should start changing my routine or maybe trying to document them without them knowing i'm onto them? how can i do counter-surveillance without making it obvious i'm watching back?",
